query
EXPLAIN SELECT count(*) FROM read_parquet('${__TEST_DIR__}/psp.parquet') WHERE s <> '';
----
QUERY PLAN
╭─ UNGROUPED_AGGREGATE ────╮
│ Aggregates: count_star() │
│ ~1 row                   │
╰─────────────┬────────────╯
╭─ READ_PARQUET ───────────╮
│ Function: READ_PARQUET   │
│ Column Filter: s > 0     │
│ ~8,000 rows              │
╰──────────────────────────╯


query
SELECT count(*) AS n FROM read_parquet('${__TEST_DIR__}/psp.parquet') USING SAMPLE 10% (system, 7);
----
n
2048


